{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>From the wilderness of Sin, by their stages.</b> It employs a concise style, for from the wilderness of Sin they traveled to Dophkah, and from Dophkah to Alush, and from Alush to Rephidim; but because of the disgrace of Israel — that they wanted to return to Egypt — he shortened two stages for them."], :book :exodus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 17, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:58:16.796421026Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}